1601 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 323 0 R
/T (This micro project focuses on importing structured data from an external spreadsheet into the ServiceNow platform using Import Sets and Transform Maps. It simulates a real-world scenario where bulk employee data is received in Excel format and must be migrated into ServiceNow efficiently and accurately.)
/E (This micro project focuses on importing structured data from an external spreadsheet into the ServiceNow platform using Import Sets and Transform Maps. It simulates a real-world scenario where bulk employee data is received in Excel format and must be migrated into ServiceNow efficiently and accurately.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1602 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 323 0 R
/T (The spreadsheet data is first loaded into an Import Set table, which serves as a staging area. A Transform Map is then configured to map the source fields to the appropriate target table fields. On executing the transformation, records are created in the target table and validated to ensure data integrity. The project was later extended with Coalesce \(to avoid duplicate records\), Reports and a Dashboard.)
/E (The spreadsheet data is first loaded into an Import Set table, which serves as a staging area. A Transform Map is then configured to map the source fields to the appropriate target table fields. On executing the transformation, records are created in the target table and validated to ensure data integrity. The project was later extended with Coalesce \(to avoid duplicate records\), Reports and a Dashboard.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
1603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 323 0 R
/T (2. IDEATION PHASE)
/E (2. IDEATION PHASE)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1604 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 323 0 R
/T (2.1 Problem Statement)
/E (2.1 Problem Statement)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
1605 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 323 0 R
/T (Organizations frequently receive employee data in spreadsheet format from HR or external systems. Entering this data manually into ServiceNow is slow and error-prone, and importing the same file more than once can create duplicate employee records. There is a need for a reliable, repeatable way to bulk-load spreadsheet data, update existing records instead of duplicating them, and monitor the data visually.)
/E (Organizations frequently receive employee data in spreadsheet format from HR or external systems. Entering this data manually into ServiceNow is slow and error-prone, and importing the same file more than once can create duplicate employee records. There is a need for a reliable, repeatable way to bulk-load spreadsheet data, update existing records instead of duplicating them, and monitor the data visually.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
